---
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<html lang="de" class="scroll-smooth">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#2563eb" />
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Ihre moderne Zahnarztpraxis in München für schmerzfreie Zahnheilkunde, Prophylaxe und Implantologie."
    />
    <meta property="og:title" content="Praxis Dr. Weiss | Moderne Zahnheilkunde München" />
    <meta
      property="og:description"
      content="Ihre moderne Zahnarztpraxis in München für schmerzfreie Zahnheilkunde, Prophylaxe und Implantologie."
    />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <title>Praxis Dr. Weiss | Moderne Zahnheilkunde München</title>
  </head>
  <body class="min-h-screen bg-slate-50 text-slate-900 antialiased">
    <div class="bg-white">
      <header class="sticky top-0 z-50 border-b border-slate-100 bg-white/80 backdrop-blur-md">
        <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl items-center justify-between px-4 py-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
          <a href="#" class="flex items-center gap-3" aria-label="Praxis Dr. Weiss Startseite">
            <div class="flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-blue-600 text-white shadow-lg shadow-blue-200">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M12 3.5c2.8 0 4.7 1.7 5.2 4.2.4 2.1-.5 4.4-2.1 6.1l-3.1 2.8-3.1-2.8C6.3 12.1 5.4 9.8 5.8 7.7 6.3 5.2 8.2 3.5 12 3.5Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                <path d="M9.5 10.8h5M12 8.2v5.2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900">Praxis Dr. Weiss</p>
              <p class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-slate-500">Zahnmedizin</p>
            </div>
          </a>

          <nav class="hidden items-center gap-8 text-sm font-medium text-slate-600 md:flex">
            <a href="#leistungen" class="relative pb-1 transition-all duration-200 hover:text-slate-900 after:absolute after:bottom-0 after:left-0 after:h-0.5 after:w-full after:origin-left after:scale-x-0 after:bg-blue-600 after:transition-transform after:duration-200 after:content-[''] hover:after:scale-x-100">Leistungen</a>
            <a href="#ueber-uns" class="relative pb-1 transition-all duration-200 hover:text-slate-900 after:absolute after:bottom-0 after:left-0 after:h-0.5 after:w-full after:origin-left after:scale-x-0 after:bg-blue-600 after:transition-transform after:duration-200 after:content-[''] hover:after:scale-x-100">Über uns</a>
            <a href="#team" class="relative pb-1 transition-all duration-200 hover:text-slate-900 after:absolute after:bottom-0 after:left-0 after:h-0.5 after:w-full after:origin-left after:scale-x-0 after:bg-blue-600 after:transition-transform after:duration-200 after:content-[''] hover:after:scale-x-100">Team</a>
            <a href="#kontakt" class="relative pb-1 transition-all duration-200 hover:text-slate-900 after:absolute after:bottom-0 after:left-0 after:h-0.5 after:w-full after:origin-left after:scale-x-0 after:bg-blue-600 after:transition-transform after:duration-200 after:content-[''] hover:after:scale-x-100">Kontakt</a>
          </nav>

          <button
            id="menu-toggle"
            type="button"
            class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-white text-slate-700 shadow-sm transition md:hidden"
            aria-expanded="false"
            aria-label="Menü öffnen"
          >
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            </svg>
          </button>

          <a
            href="#kontakt"
            class="hidden items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-blue-600 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-lg shadow-blue-200 transition-all duration-200 hover:bg-blue-700 hover:shadow-xl active:scale-95 md:inline-flex"
          >
            Termin vereinbaren
          </a>
        </div>

        <div id="mobile-menu" class="hidden border-t border-slate-100 bg-white/90 px-4 py-4 md:hidden">
          <nav class="flex flex-col gap-4 text-sm font-medium text-slate-600">
            <a href="#leistungen" class="transition hover:text-slate-900">Leistungen</a>
            <a href="#ueber-uns" class="transition hover:text-slate-900">Über uns</a>
            <a href="#team" class="transition hover:text-slate-900">Team</a>
            <a href="#kontakt" class="transition hover:text-slate-900">Kontakt</a>
            <a href="#kontakt" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-blue-600 px-4 py-2.5 font-semibold text-white">Termin vereinbaren</a>
          </nav>
        </div>
      </header>

      <main>
        <section id="hero" class="scroll-mt-24 mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 pb-16 pt-10 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 lg:pb-24 lg:pt-16">
          <div class="grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1.12fr_0.88fr]">
            <div class="max-w-xl hero-fade-in">
              <div class="mb-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-blue-100 bg-blue-50 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium text-blue-700">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path d="M7 12.5 10 15.5 17 8.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                </svg>
                Moderne Zahnpraxis in München
              </div>

              <h1 class="text-4xl font-black tracking-[-0.06em] text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl lg:text-7xl">
                Ihr <span class="text-blue-600">sicheres</span> Lächeln.<br />Ihre <span class="text-blue-600">ruhige</span> Zukunft.
              </h1>

              <p class="mt-6 max-w-lg text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">
                Individuelle Behandlung, modernste Technologien und eine ruhige Atmosphäre – damit Ihre Zahngesundheit ganz ohne Stress wieder in guten Händen ist.
              </p>

              <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row hero-fade-in-delayed">
                <a href="#kontakt" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-blue-600 px-7 py-3.5 text-base font-semibold text-white shadow-[0_16px_35px_rgba(37,99,235,0.35)] transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-blue-700 hover:shadow-[0_20px_40px_rgba(37,99,235,0.4)] active:scale-95">
                  kostenloses Erstgespräch
                </a>
                <a href="#leistungen" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-slate-200 bg-white px-7 py-3.5 text-base font-semibold text-slate-700 transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-50 hover:shadow-md active:scale-95">
                  Mehr erfahren
                </a>
              </div>

              <div class="mt-8 grid max-w-lg gap-3 sm:grid-cols-3">
                <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-3 shadow-sm">
                  <p class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900">4.9/5</p>
                  <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-500">Bewertungen</p>
                </div>
                <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-3 shadow-sm">
                  <p class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900">1.170+</p>
                  <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-500">Patienten</p>
                </div>
                <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-3 shadow-sm">
                  <p class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900">15+</p>
                  <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-500">Jahre Erfahrung</p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-3 text-sm text-slate-500">
                <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2">
                  <span class="flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-3.5 w-3.5" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
                      <path d="M7 12.5 10 15.5 17 8.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                    </svg>
                  </span>
                  Zertifizierte Qualität
                </div>
                <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2">
                  <span class="flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-600">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-3.5 w-3.5" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
                      <path d="M12 3v18M3 12h18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                    </svg>
                  </span>
                  Flexible Termine
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="relative">
              <div class="absolute -left-5 top-12 z-20 hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 shadow-xl shadow-slate-200/80 md:block">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                  <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-blue-600">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
                      <path d="m12 3.5 2.5 5.2 5.7.8-4.1 4 1 5.7-5.1-2.7-5.1 2.7 1-5.7-4.1-4 5.7-.8L12 3.5Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                    </svg>
                  </div>
                  <div>
                    <p class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">4.9/5</p>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Bewertungen</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-[32px] border border-slate-200 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 via-white to-sky-50 p-3 shadow-[0_35px_90px_rgba(15,23,42,0.12)] sm:p-5">
                <img
                  src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1629909613654-28e377c37b09?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80"
                  alt="Zahnarztpraxis mit modernen Behandlungseinheiten"
                  class="h-[520px] w-full rounded-[26px] object-cover object-center"
                />
                <div class="absolute inset-x-5 bottom-5 rounded-[24px] border border-white/20 bg-slate-900/75 p-4 text-white backdrop-blur-sm">
                  <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
                    <div>
                      <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-slate-300">Praxis Dr. Weiss</p>
                      <p class="mt-2 text-2xl font-bold">Gesundheit mit Vertrauen</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-blue-500/20 text-blue-200">
                      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
                        <path d="M9 5.5a3 3 0 0 1 6 0M12 13c-3.5 0-6.5 2.5-6.5 6.5h13C18.5 15.5 15.5 13 12 13Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                      </svg>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="absolute -bottom-6 right-3 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 shadow-xl shadow-slate-200/80 md:right-6">
                <p class="text-3xl font-black text-slate-900">12.400+</p>
                <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Erfolgreiche Behandlungen</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 pb-8 pt-2 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
          <div class="grid gap-4 rounded-[30px] border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 shadow-[0_20px_50px_rgba(15,23,42,0.05)] sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
            <div class="rounded-[22px] bg-slate-50 p-5">
              <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-blue-600">Qualität</p>
              <p class="mt-3 text-2xl font-black text-slate-900">Modern</p>
              <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Digitale Diagnostik und moderne, sichere Behandlungswege.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-[22px] bg-blue-50 p-5">
              <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-blue-600">Vertrauen</p>
              <p class="mt-3 text-2xl font-black text-slate-900">4.9/5</p>
              <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Starke Bewertungen und ein persönlicher, ruhiger Behandlungsstil.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-[22px] bg-emerald-50 p-5">
              <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-emerald-700">Flexibel</p>
              <p class="mt-3 text-2xl font-black text-slate-900">Schnell</p>
              <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Zuverlässige Terminvorschläge und kompakte Behandlungspfade.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-[22px] bg-violet-50 p-5">
              <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-violet-700">Persönlich</p>
              <p class="mt-3 text-2xl font-black text-slate-900">Individuell</p>
              <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Jede Behandlung wird auf Ihre Bedürfnisse und Ihr Lächeln abgestimmt.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section id="ueber-uns" class="scroll-mt-24 mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-24 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
          <div class="grid items-center gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1fr]">
            <div>
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-blue-600">Über uns</p>
              <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl">Mehr als Zahnmedizin – eine ruhige Praxis für langfristige Gesundheit</h2>
              <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">
                In unserer Praxis Dr. Weiss verbinden wir moderne Zahnmedizin mit persönlicher Betreuung, klaren Behandlungsempfehlungen und einer Atmosphäre, die Sicherheit schafft. Jede Behandlung wird individuell an Ihre Bedürfnisse angepasst – mit Fokus auf Prävention, Ästhetik und nachhaltige Ergebnisse.
              </p>

              <div class="mt-8 space-y-4">
                <div class="flex items-start gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 shadow-sm">
                  <div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-blue-50 text-blue-600">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
                      <path d="M7 15V9m5 6V5m5 10v-8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                    </svg>
                  </div>
                  <div>
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">Moderne Technologie</h3>
                    <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-600">Digitale Diagnostik, 3D-Röntgen und moderne Behandlungsmethoden für präzise Ergebnisse.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="flex items-start gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 shadow-sm">
                  <div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-600">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
                      <path d="M12 21s6-4.8 6-10A6 6 0 1 0 6 11c0 5.2 6 10 6 10Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/>
                      <path d="M9.5 12.5 11 14l3.5-4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                    </svg>
                  </div>
                  <div>
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">Schmerzfreie Behandlung</h3>
                    <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-600">Sanfte Verfahren und gut strukturierte Behandlungspläne sorgen für mehr Ruhe und Vertrauen.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="flex items-start gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-4 shadow-sm">
                  <div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-violet-50 text-violet-600">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
                      <path d="M6 18.5V9.8A2.8 2.8 0 0 1 8.8 7h6.4A2.8 2.8 0 0 1 18 9.8v8.7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                      <path d="M9 7V5.8A3 3 0 0 1 12 3a3 3 0 0 1 3 2.8V7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                    </svg>
                  </div>
                  <div>
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">Wohlfühlatmosphäre</h3>
                    <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-600">Eine freundliche, ruhige Umgebung, die auch bei Angst vor Behandlungen ein Gefühl von Sicherheit vermittelt.</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-[32px] border border-slate-200 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 via-slate-800 to-blue-900 p-7 shadow-[0_30px_80px_rgba(15,23,42,0.12)]">
              <div class="rounded-[28px] border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-6 backdrop-blur-sm">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                  <div>
                    <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-blue-200">Praxisprofil</p>
                    <h3 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-bold text-white">Patientenorientiert. Präzise. Vertrauensvoll.</h3>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
                  <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-4">
                    <p class="text-3xl font-black text-white">15+</p>
                    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-200">Jahre Erfahrung</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-4">
                    <p class="text-3xl font-black text-white">5.000+</p>
                    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-200">Zufriedene Patienten</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-4">
                    <p class="text-3xl font-black text-white">3D</p>
                    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-200">Digitale Diagnostik</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-4">
                    <p class="text-3xl font-black text-white">24/7</p>
                    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-200">Notfallberatung</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section id="leistungen" class="scroll-mt-24 bg-slate-50 py-24">
          <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
            <div class="mb-10 text-center">
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-blue-600">Leistungen</p>
              <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl">Umfassende Zahnmedizin für Ihr Lächeln</h2>
            </div>

            <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-4">
              <article class="group rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1.5 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-blue-100/70">
                <div class="flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-blue-50 text-blue-600 transition group-hover:bg-blue-600 group-hover:text-white">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-7 w-7" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path d="M8 9.8c0-2.2 1.7-4 4-4s4 1.8 4 4v4.7c0 2.7-1.8 4.5-4 4.5s-4-1.8-4-4.5V9.8Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                    <path d="M9 9.5h6M12 5.5v8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="mt-5 text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Professionelle Zahnreinigung</h3>
                <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Sanfte, gründliche Reinigung zur Vorbeugung von Karies und Zahnfleischentzündungen.</p>
              </article>

              <article class="group rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1.5 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-blue-100/70">
                <div class="flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-violet-50 text-violet-600 transition group-hover:bg-violet-600 group-hover:text-white">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-7 w-7" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
                    <path d="M12 3.2c1.8 3 6 4.2 6 8.7 0 3.4-2.7 6.8-6 8.9-3.3-2.1-6-5.5-6-8.9 0-4.5 4.2-5.7 6-8.7Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                    <path d="M9.5 12.5 11 14l3.5-4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
                  </svg>
                </div>
                <h3 class="mt-5 text-xl font-bold text-slate-900">Ästhetische Zahnheilkunde</h3>
                <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Bleaching, Veneers und individuelle kosmetische Lösungen für ein natürliches, strahlendes Lächeln.</p>
              </article>

              <article class="group rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1.5 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-blue-100/70">
